-- title:
--   Convex model sphere reeb transport
-- statement:
--   Given positive Hamiltonian contact pairing on a convex model boundary, the inverse-gauge chart admits a sphere-tangent normalized Reeb vector whose pushforward is the contact-normalized Hamiltonian vector.
--
--   All displayed regularity, tangency, normalization and supplied-data hypotheses of the exact formal statement are retained. This is a conditional result for the defined convex regularization model, not a global-section or index-existence theorem.
